For full marks expect a fully stated more specific aim (objective-like) e.g.

to investigate the relative importance ** (1)** of the location factors ** (1)** of supermarkets ** (1)**; 
 to investigate how various types ** (1)** of location factor ** (1)**determine bank locations ** (1)**; 
to investigate how various service industry location factors** (1)**  
work together to attract industry ** (1)**.

Award 1 mark for outlines and broad intentions e.g.
to investigate service industry location factor overlap ** (1)**;
to investigate what factors attract service industry ** (1)**.
